<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>Admin Dashboard</title>
    <style>
        body { font-family: Arial; padding: 20px; }
        .container { max-width: 800px; margin: auto; }
        .nav a { margin-right: 15px; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <h1>Welcome, Developer!</h1>
        <p>You are logged in as user ID: {{user}}</p>
        <div class="nav">
            <a href="/admin/users">Manage Users</a>
            <a href="/admin/items">Manage Items</a>
            <a href="/admin/sections">Manage Sections</a>
            <a href="/logout">Logout</a>
        </div>
        <hr>
        <p>This is your admin dashboard. (Handlebars rendering)</p>
        <p>For other users, they will receive a JSON token upon login.</p>
    </div>
</body>
</html>